      <p><strong>Zennly is a multi-branch booking and operations platform for appointment-based service businesses in Nepal.</strong> It was founded in 2026 and serves spas, salons, tattoo studios, gyms, physiotherapy clinics and cleaning services. It is built by <a href="https://zunkireelabs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zunkireelabs</a> and based in Lalitpur, Nepal.</p>

      <h2>Is Zennly booking software?</h2>
      <p>Yes. Zennly (zennly.io) is web-based booking and business management software for spas, salons and other service businesses in Nepal. It is not related to other sites that use the name Zennly, such as zennly.org.</p>

      <h2>What Zennly does</h2>
      <p>Zennly replaces phone calls and spreadsheets with one system: online booking, staff and room scheduling, discount requests with manager approval and an audit trail, payment tracking by method, and a locked daily reconciliation across every branch. A therapist, stylist, artist or trainer, the room, and the time are booked together, and clashes are refused at database level, so double-bookings cannot happen.</p>

      <h2>Who it is for</h2>
      <p>Owners and managers of appointment-based businesses in Nepal &ndash; single-branch or multi-branch &ndash; who need one view of bookings, staff and revenue. See the industries we serve: <a href="/solutions/spa/">spas</a>, <a href="/solutions/salon/">salons</a>, <a href="/solutions/tattoo/">tattoo studios</a>, <a href="/solutions/fitness/">gyms</a>, <a href="/solutions/physiotherapy/">physiotherapy clinics</a> and <a href="/solutions/cleaning/">cleaning services</a>.</p>

      <h2>Proof it works in the real world</h2>
      <p>Zennly runs live at Nuad Thai Spa Kathmandu across four branches, 39 therapists, 12 rooms and 194 services. Read the <a href="/case-study/">full case study</a>.</p>

